/E (A weather station sends packets that carry exactly one kind of value: a temperature \(float\), a humidity percentage \(int\) or a short status text \(up to 7 characters\). The station has very little memory and stores thousands of packets. Design the packet as a structure and as a tagged union, predict and verify sizeof, implement the tagged union with a printing function, and test what happens when the wrong member is read.)
