530 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 135 0 R
/T (A temperature of 31.5 was stored and then the humidity \(int\) member was read. The output was 1107034112, not 31. A float is saved in memory as IEEE-754 bits; 31.5 is stored as the bit pattern 0x41FC0000. Reading the same four bytes as an int gives the number 0x41FC0000 = 1107034112. The union does not convert anything. That is why the tag must be checked before reading a member.)
/E (A temperature of 31.5 was stored and then the humidity \(int\) member was read. The output was 1107034112, not 31. A float is saved in memory as IEEE-754 bits; 31.5 is stored as the bit pattern 0x41FC0000. Reading the same four bytes as an int gives the number 0x41FC0000 = 1107034112. The union does not convert anything. That is why the tag must be checked before reading a member.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [37]
>>
endobj
