/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 144 0 R
/T (Safe stock update: record_sale\(\) first finds the item, checks qty <= stock, and only then changes stock and sold. A refused sale changes nothing. Expiry check: both dates are converted to day numbers by days_of\(struct Date *\) and subtracted; a result of 2 or less \(or negative\) gives a warning. The union member is read only when kind == PACKAGED. Static or global: today's date and the day's total are file-level static variables \(one copy, private to the file, live for the whole program\). The menu is not global; it is passed to the functions by pointer.)
/E (Safe stock update: record_sale\(\) first finds the item, checks qty <= stock, and only then changes stock and sold. A refused sale changes nothing. Expiry check: both dates are converted to day numbers by days_of\(struct Date *\) and subtracted; a result of 2 or less \(or negative\) gives a warning. The union member is read only when kind == PACKAGED. Static or global: today's date and the day's total are file-level static variables \(one copy, private to the file, live for the whole program\). The menu is not global; it is passed to the functions by pointer.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [62]
