/T (The canteen program works for all required cases: normal sales updated the stock, the oversized sale was refused without changing the stock, the expiring item was warned, and the summary was sorted by revenue with the correct total \(Rs 240\). I learned how nested structures, a tagged union and structure pointers work together in one design.)
