/Title (Nested structures: Date and Time are small structures placed inside the item. Array of structures: struct Item menu[10] holds all items. Tagged union: the field kind \(enum PACKAGED, COOKED, COMBO\) is the tag, and a union holds either the expiry Date, the prepared Time or the three combo ids, because an item has only one of them. This saves memory and keeps each item as one record.)
