<<
/Title (A temperature of 31.5 was stored and then the humidity \(int\) member was read. The output was 1107034112, not 31. A float is saved in memory as IEEE-754 bits; 31.5 is stored as the bit pattern 0x41FC0000. Reading the same four bytes as an int gives the number 0x41FC0000 = 1107034112. The union does not convert anything. That is why the tag must be checked before reading a member.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1927 0 R
>>
endobj
